==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|Irish|slang|lang=en}} A job or income which is taken in addition to one's normal employment, generally at evenings or weekends. Originally implied that payment was not declared for taxation, but now refers to any work that is not part of one's regular job.
#: ''John has a '''nixer''' on Saturdays as a barman.''

